  "comments": [
    {
      "position": 0,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "You don't normally 読んでみせる to a baby. 読んであげる, you do.",
      "html": "You don't normally 読んでみせる to a baby. 読んであげる, you do.",
      "credits_raw": "bamboo4",
      "content_sha256": "2018d366b8426da9841481cf992f945fc570caa7b837b584571e8f8f5ba74e49",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 1,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "\"読んであげる, you do\" that sounds very new york jewish word order somehow! that food, I want it! maybe yiddish and japanese has a lot in common grammatically...",
      "html": "\"読んであげる, you do\" that sounds very new york jewish word order somehow! that food, I want it! maybe yiddish and japanese has a lot in common grammatically...",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "62169a81d604ccef1733aa7b79fbf0ad238a2e2336cadd2acaa38156403b33d3",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "This means something like in English, I will show them/you!",
      "html": "This means something like in English, I will show them/you!",
      "credits_raw": "キツネ",
      "content_sha256": "6d554018b2bae73155997d221283a5a9322e075940da68dc51dc00334e5dd985",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "the way of using 見せる in N2 is not just \"to show\". That's the common 使役形 of using the verb 見る that you learn in N5/N4. The way it's meant to be used here is in the form A-て見せる form. There, it means \"definitely\" doing A\n\nLike in:\n今度こそちゃんと勝って見せるよ！\nこんどこそかってみせるよ！\nNext time I'll definitely win. (literally, \"Next time, I'll show (someone) that I'll win.\")",
      "html": "the way of using 見せる in N2 is not just \"to show\". That's the common 使役形 of using the verb 見る that you learn in N5/N4. The way it's meant to be used here is in the form A-て見せる form. There, it means \"definitely\" doing A<br/><br/>Like in:<br/>今度こそちゃんと勝って見せるよ！<br/>こんどこそかってみせるよ！<br/>Next time I'll definitely win. (literally, \"Next time, I'll show (someone) that I'll win.\")",
      "credits_raw": "新丸子",
      "content_sha256": "84310988faf775e380f4f8d792e0f52d5a4625e7fb686d654d16aaa46e44a281",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    }
  ],
